# SARA role multiplicity over a symbolic list

> Module SaraRoleCount

> Using SaraWorld as W
> Using SaraIncome as I
> Using Section152 as S152

This concolic harness adds no rule of its own. It exposes
`SaraIncome.role_count`, which implements the multiplicity of an entity in an
event-role list, and `Section152.dates_or`, whose empty/non-empty choice is a
real SARA branch, through a scope so CUTECat can supply bounded symbolic lists.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope RoleCount:
  input roles content list of W.Entity
  input sought content W.Entity
  input dates content list of date
  input fallback content date
  output count content integer
  output selected_date_count content integer
```

```catala
scope RoleCount:
  definition count equals I.role_count of roles, sought
  definition selected_date_count equals
    number of (S152.dates_or of dates, fallback)
```
